                                                "sense_id": "987b14a9-8db2-3b19-bec0-9c2f7239f075",
                                                "text": "Medicare data was \"younged\" by a month to achieve conformity with the conventional completed ages recorded in the census."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5578c84c-caf5-3b18-8e55-90ebaa41feaa",
                                        "entry_id": "e0ceb0e9-ed40-3941-9f8c-4396735039ea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To exhibit younging."
