                                                "sense_id": "5578c84c-caf5-3b18-8e55-90ebaa41feaa",
                                                "text": "Shoshonitic magmatism younged southwards in the Superior Province, commensurate with the southwardly diachronous accretion of allochthonous subprovinces."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e1e6c1a-0fd1-4724-874e-8f77a358bfa5",
                                                "sense_id": "5578c84c-caf5-3b18-8e55-90ebaa41feaa",
                                                "text": "The existence of magmatic belts younging northward implies that slabs of Asian mantle subducted one after another under ranges north of the Himalayas."
